              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 1,
              "text": "第5章 为生活奔波"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 2,
              "text": "翌日早晨。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 3,
              "text": "吵醒苏天晴的是早上八点的闹钟。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 4,
              "text": "一团蠕动的被子在床上蛄蛹，迅速从里面伸出一只小手关掉闹钟，好像里面藏着什么狐狸妖怪。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 5,
              "text": "只见那狐狸妖怪在床上翻了个身，然后猛地怪叫："
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 6,
              "text": "“咕哇！好疼！”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 7,
              "text": "金毛狐狐压到了自己的尾巴。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 8,
              "text": "."
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 9,
              "text": "苏天晴从床上坐起，头发乱糟糟地落在身边，眼皮与耳朵一同耷拉着提不起精神，只有尾巴根的刺痛在提醒着自己——以后绝对不能平躺着睡。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 10,
              "text": "“嗯……嗯唔——~”"
            }
          ],
