              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 79,
              "text": "一边安抚着躁动的肚皮，一边思索着未来。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 80,
              "text": "希望自己的书能尽快过稿吧，这样下个月的五百块全勤就能吃到了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 81,
              "text": "那么接下来……"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 82,
              "text": "狐狐从桌上拿起那本秘典。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 83,
              "text": "200个关注者，魔法少女代号，这两个任务自己没有半点想法。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
              "paragraph": 84,
              "text": "接着苏天晴注意到了今天的每日任务。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c05",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 5,
